  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CN Investigations and Operations under U.S. Africa Command. The U.S. Department of Defense International Counter-Drug Program (ICDP) enables the Secretary of Defense to provide foreign governments with support, such as training and equipment, to combat illicit drug trafficking and transnational organized crime.</narrative>
